</a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"5afa52206af94631b3e62e029ab927dc\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"465e4888fa894c5e9f8e1ee7d89a2b27\">            <p></p>            <p> 本团队致力于智能感知与自主规划技术研究，长期招聘相关博士后科研人员，除享受学校提供待遇外，团队给予丰厚的科研经费和奖金绩效，欢迎志同道合的人才加盟。</p>            <p></p>           </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"fdcc84f8d6e180256bbf0173cc5da83apart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: block;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(116, 110, 111);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Biographical Information</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display: flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"b20d22eba1d9fc45cbcf59682be1e100\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display: none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"74d19a9bfbe61b8430970a831f7f733a\">           <p style=\"text-indent: 37px;\">Jifeng <span style=\"text-indent:37px;\">Guo</span>, Doctoral Supervisor, Professor in the School of Astronautics at Harbin Institute of Technology (HIT). He conducts fundamental and engineering research on spacecraft systems, on-orbit servicing technologies, and unmanned systems. He serves on professional committees of the Chinese Society of Astronautics and the Chinese Society of Space Research, and sits on the editorial boards of the Journal of Astronautics, Unmanned Systems Technology, Aerospace Control, and the Journal of Command and Control. He has led more than 50 national-level science and technology projects, received 2 national and provincial science and technology awards, published two scholarly monographs, authored over 50 papers, and holds more than 40 invention patents.</p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>   </div>   </div> </body></html>"